cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it."
title: "Black-Box Multi-Objective Autoscaling Benchmark: paper artifact"
abstract: >-
  A black-box multi-objective benchmark for Kubernetes autoscaling over latency,
  cost and energy, with static, edge-cloud and dynamic variants, a calibrated
  oracle, a held-out evaluation protocol, five method baselines and testbed
  validation scripts and data.
authors:
